<Article
  seoTitle="How to record a Zoom, Meet or Teams call on Mac, both sides"
  description="Record a video call on your Mac with the other people's audio and your own voice on separate tracks, then add captions and cut the dead air. Free, macOS 15 or later."
  path={path} og="guide-record-meeting"
  title="How to record a Zoom, Meet or Teams call on your Mac"
  lede="To record a call with both sides, you need two sounds: what your Mac plays (the other people) and your microphone (you). Reelbird records both, plus the call window, as separate tracks, with no virtual audio driver. Ask everyone first."
  crumbs={[{ name: "Guides", path: "/guides/" }, { name: "Record a meeting", path }]}
